title: Same content, same hash
title-zh: 内容相同，哈希相同
---
# A recipes repository with two commits
> mkdir recipes
> cd recipes
> git init
+hidden README.md
# Family recipes

Recipes we cook again and again.
+end
> git add README.md
> git commit -m "Add a README"
+hidden pancakes.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
+end
> git add pancakes.md
> git commit -m "Add a pancake recipe"
$ git hash-object pancakes.md
+file pancakes-copy.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
+end
$ git hash-object pancakes-copy.md
+file pancakes-copy.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk.
+end
$ git hash-object pancakes-copy.md
